      "timing": "jit"
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "position": 2,
      "raw_text": "Meanwhile, finely grate 4 ounces Pecorino Romano cheese on a Microplane or on the very small round holes of a box grater into a medium heatproof bowl (about 2 1/2 cups).",
